<h1>Refund Policy</h1>

<p><strong>Last Updated:</strong>September 2026</p>

<p>Thank you for shopping with Anaya 3D Prints. Please read this Refund Policy carefully before placing your order.</p>

<h2>All Sales Are Final</h2>
<p>
    Due to the custom and made-to-order nature of 3D printing, <strong>all sales are final</strong>.
    Once an order is submitted and production begins, it cannot be canceled, refunded, or altered.
</p>

<h2>Custom & Personalized Orders</h2>
<p>
    Custom models, personalized prints, and special designs are created specifically for you.
    As a result, these items cannot be returned or refunded under any circumstances.
</p>

<h2>Reporting Damage</h2>
<p>
    If your item arrives damaged, you must contact us within <strong>7 days of delivery</strong>.
    Please include clear photos of the damage so we can review the issue.
</p>
<p>
    While refunds are not offered, we may provide a replacement or partial credit at our discretion
    depending on the nature of the damage.
</p>

<h2>Customer Responsibility</h2>
<p>
    Customers are responsible for providing accurate shipping information, design specifications,
    and order details. We cannot refund orders due to user-submitted errors.
</p>

<h2>Contact Us</h2>
<p>
    Questions about this Refund Policy can be sent to:<br />
    <strong>Anaya 3D Prints</strong><br />
    Email: [your email]<br />
    Address: [your address]
</p>


