<h1>Shipping Policy</h1>
<p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> [Insert Date]</p>

<p>
    This Shipping Policy explains how Anaya 3D Prints processes, packages, and ships orders.
    By placing an order, you agree to the terms below.
</p>

<h2>Production Time</h2>
<p>
    All 3D-printed items are made to order. Production times vary depending on model complexity, 
    queue volume, and print size. Most orders ship within <strong>[insert typical timeframe]</strong>,
    but custom prints may require additional time.
</p>

<h2>Shipping Time</h2>
<p>
    Shipping time depends on your location and the selected carrier. Once shipped, your order is 
    typically delivered within <strong>[insert typical carrier timeframe]</strong>.
</p>

<h2>Shipping Carriers</h2>
<p>
    We ship using major carriers such as USPS, UPS, or FedEx. Carrier selection may vary depending
    on package size, weight, and destination.
</p>

<h2>Tracking Information</h2>
<p>
    You will receive tracking information via email once your order is shipped.
    Tracking updates may take 24–48 hours to appear depending on the carrier.
</p>

<h2>Incorrect Addresses</h2>
<p>
    Customers are responsible for ensuring that all shipping information is correct at checkout. 
    We are not responsible for delays or lost packages due to incorrectly provided addresses.
</p>

<h2>Lost or Delayed Packages</h2>
<p>
    Once a package is handed off to the shipping carrier, we are no longer responsible for carrier delays.
    If a package is lost, please contact the carrier directly with your tracking number.
</p>

<h2>Damaged Deliveries</h2>
<p>
    If your order arrives damaged, contact us within <strong>7 days</strong> with photos so we can evaluate the issue.
</p>

<h2>International Shipping</h2>
<p>
    International shipping may be available upon request. Additional fees, customs duties,
    and taxes may apply and are the responsibility of the customer.
</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>
    Questions about this Shipping Policy can be sent to:<br />
    <strong>Anaya 3D Prints</strong><br />
    Email: anaya3dprints@gmail.com<br />
</p>
